Package: slice
Title: Sparse and Low-Rank Precision Matrix Estimation for Single-Layer and Multilayer Graphical Models
Version: 0.0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Martin", "Ondrus", email = "mondrus@ualberta.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Martin Ondrus [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Martin Ondrus <mondrus@ualberta.ca>
Description: Implements methods for estimating sparse and low-rank precision (inverse covariance) matrices in latent-variable Gaussian graphical models. The package provides two related estimators: 'slice' for single-layer graphical models and 'multislice' for multilayer settings where multiple related covariance structures are jointly modeled. The algorithms combine sparse regularization and low-rank structure to recover conditional dependencies and latent components. Several sparse penalties (including LASSO and SCAD) are supported, and model selection can be performed using cross-validation.
